{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "f4100a4a-4fa4-4f4b-aada-fc27a2e9ef48", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T14:39:52Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-128_middle_kingdoms_silsangsa-gaesan", "lang": "ko", "locator": "역사적 변천", "pageSha256": "c8c77e5496e25934a3503ea71e40eb5907649e3471203ab19672e6c694b0335e", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0033656", "sourceId": "src-syj128-aks-silsangsa", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0033656", "text": "하나인 실상산문(實相山門) 을 개산(開山)하면서 창건하였다."}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "f4100a4a-4fa4-4f4b-aada-fc27a2e9ef48", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T14:39:52Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-128_middle_kingdoms_silsangsa-jeonpa", "lang": "ko", "locator": "역사적 변천", "pageSha256": "c8c77e5496e25934a3503ea71e40eb5907649e3471203ab19672e6c694b0335e", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0033656", "sourceId": "src-syj128-aks-silsangsa", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0033656", "text": "홍척은 이 절을 세운 뒤 선종(禪宗) 을 전파하였는데"}
